    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present this superb, detached family home, ideally positioned in one of Dublin's most sought-after residential settings. Extending to approximately 198.7 sq. m. (2,138 sq. ft.), this impressive residence has been thoughtfully refurbished and extended to create a beautiful, comfortable home perfectly suited to modern family living.\n\nFrom the moment you enter, the property impresses with its wonderful sense of space, warmth and natural light. The well-appointed accommodation briefly comprises a spacious entrance hall, kitchen/dining/living room, elegant sitting room, family room, utility room, shower room and a double bedroom on the ground floor. Upstairs, there are four generously proportioned bedrooms, a family bathroom and cloakroom, providing excellent accommodation for a growing family.\n\nOne of the property's outstanding features is the magnificent private rear garden. Predominantly laid in lawn, it incorporates a superb decking area, perfect for outdoor dining and entertaining, together with an attractive selection of mature trees, plants and shrubs. The garden enjoys a particularly special outlook over the mature fairways of Elm Park Golf Course, creating a wonderfully private and tranquil setting that is rarely found so close to the city. To the front, a well-maintained garden is complemented by ample off-street parking.\n\nThe location is exceptional. The property is within easy walking distance of the DART and QBC, providing convenient access to Dublin city centre, while Dublin Airport is readily accessible via Aircoach or the Port Tunnel. Blackrock Village is close by, with its excellent selection of boutique shops, cafés and restaurants, while Blackrock Park provides a pleasant pedestrian route into the village. Dundrum, Stillorgan and Merrion shopping centres are also just a short drive away.\nThe area is particularly well served by many of Dublin's leading schools and universities, while Elm Park Golf and Sports Club, St Vincent's University Hospital and Blackrock Clinic are all within easy reach.\n\nThis exceptional home offers a rare combination of generous accommodation, privacy, mature surroundings and outstanding convenience. It represents a superb opportunity to acquire a truly special family residence in a highly desirable Dublin location.\n\nSPECIAL FEATURES\nImpressive, detached family residence.\nPrime residential location.\nOverlooking Elm Park Golf Course to the rear.\nBright and spacious accommodation throughout.\nBeautiful private back garden with outstanding golf course views.\nIdeal family home with generous reception and bedroom accommodation.\nClose to a range of excellent schools and minutes' walk to University College Dublin.\nConvenient to the DART station at Booterstown and the Quality Bus Corridor.\nA short walk to Dublin City Centre and Dublin Bay\nGenerous off-street parking.\nMinutes' walk to the local shops and pharmacy at Woodbine Park."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway: - \nwelcoming and spacious entrance hall with solid oak Juncker flooring, ceiling coving, recessed lighting and excellent understairs storage.\n\nKitchen/Dining Family Room: - \nstunning Newcastle Designer kitchen with an excellent range of built in wall and floor presses, display cabinets, integrated six ring gas cooker, oven, hob, extractor fan. Two integrated dishwashers, integrated microwave. Island with excellent storage, Belfast sink. Velux windows allowing all the natural light to flood through. Recessed lighting. Tiled floor. Solid oak Juncker floor in the dining and family area. Underfloor heating throughout. Double doors to the magnificent and private back garden.\n\nUtility Room: - \nwith built in wall and floor presses, plumbed for washing machine and dryer, tiled floor, Velux window and recessed lighting.\n\nSitting Room: - \nattractive fireplace with wood burning stove, built in display cabinets, ceiling coving, recessed lighting, Velux windows and double doors to the back garden. Underfloor heating throughout.\n\nLiving Room: - \nwith solid oak junkers flooring, ceiling coving and recessed lighting.\n\nShower Room: - \nwith double shower unit, w.c. and wash hand basin, overhead mirrored storage press, additional mirrored storage press, heated towel rail, part tiled walls and tiled floor.Bedroom 5: spacious double bedroom with ceiling coving and recessed lighting.\n\nBedroom 5: - \nspacious double bedroom with ceiling coving and recessed lighting.\n\nUPSTAIRS - \n\n\nLanding: - \nSpacious and bright landing with access to the attic. Cloaks cupboard.\n\nMain Bedroom: - \nsuperb spacious double bedroom with floor to ceiling built in Sliderobes wardrobes. Recessed lighting. Stunning views over the back garden and Elm Park Golf Club.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nbright and spacious double bedroom with floor to ceiling built in Sliderobes wardrobes. Recessed lighting.\n\nBedroom 3: - \ndouble bedroom overlooking the garden and Elm Park Golf course. Attractive built inbuilt-in wardrobes and overhead presses.\n\nBedroom 4 / Study: - \nwith built- in wardrobes, drawers and overhead presses, display shelving and recessed lighting.\n\nBathroom: - \nshower unit, w.c. and wash hand basin with mirrored overhead storage presses, attractive part panelled walls, part tiled walls and tiled floor.\n\n"
